  "reading": {
    "en": "Rullst as `cargo rullst new` generates it (13.0.0-rc.1, with its production middleware) is in positions 3\u20134 of 14 in the overall score, at 0.86\u00d7 Axum (Axum = 1.00); in the same group as Gin (0.84\u00d7); the closest scores outside its group are Topcoat (1.03\u00d7, higher) and Loco (0.76\u00d7, lower). By category: Hello world position 3 of 14 (0.64\u00d7); Database positions 2\u20135 of 14 (1.03\u00d7); Application positions 4\u20135 of 14 (0.82\u00d7); Memory (high-water mark) positions 1\u20135 of 14 (1.00\u00d7); Startup positions 1\u20139 of 14 (1.00\u00d7). Memory: its RAM high-water mark under the Tier 3 load was 13 MiB (Axum: 17 MiB on the same runners), both counted as the 64 MiB floor of the Memory score; after the 125 logins of the application endpoints its peak was 472 MiB (Axum: 928 MiB), which no score includes. This benchmark is maintained by Rullst's maintainer, who also wrote every implementation in it and designed the method.",
    "pt_br": "O Rullst como o `cargo rullst new` o gera (13.0.0-rc.1, com o middleware de produ\u00e7\u00e3o dele) est\u00e1 nas posi\u00e7\u00f5es 3\u20134 de 14 na pontua\u00e7\u00e3o geral, com 0,86\u00d7 o Axum (Axum = 1,00); no mesmo grupo que Gin (0,84\u00d7); as pontua\u00e7\u00f5es mais pr\u00f3ximas fora do grupo s\u00e3o Topcoat (1,03\u00d7, acima) e Loco (0,76\u00d7, abaixo). Por categoria: Hello world: posi\u00e7\u00e3o 3 de 14 (0,64\u00d7); Banco de dados: posi\u00e7\u00f5es 2\u20135 de 14 (1,03\u00d7); Aplica\u00e7\u00e3o: posi\u00e7\u00f5es 4\u20135 de 14 (0,82\u00d7); Mem\u00f3ria (pico): posi\u00e7\u00f5es 1\u20135 de 14 (1,00\u00d7); Inicializa\u00e7\u00e3o: posi\u00e7\u00f5es 1\u20139 de 14 (1,00\u00d7). Mem\u00f3ria: o pico de RAM dele sob a carga do Tier 3 foi de 13 MiB (Axum: 17 MiB nas mesmas m\u00e1quinas), ambos contados como o piso de 64 MiB da pontua\u00e7\u00e3o de Mem\u00f3ria; depois dos 125 logins dos endpoints de aplica\u00e7\u00e3o, o pico dele foi de 472 MiB (Axum: 928 MiB), que nenhuma pontua\u00e7\u00e3o inclui. Este benchmark \u00e9 mantido pelo mantenedor do Rullst, que tamb\u00e9m escreveu todas as implementa\u00e7\u00f5es dele e projetou o m\u00e9todo."
